      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Saint Laurent has just unveiled its Winter 2026 costume jewelry collection, with this season's pieces taking the \"Dove\" as their guiding motif. Crafted from brass, ceramic, and rhinestones, the sculptural dove-shaped earrings are paired with resin teardrop 💧 pendants in rich oil tones of ochre, teal, and French blue. The statement-making weight of the earrings plays off beautifully against lace dresses, channeling a bold, independent vision of feminine power.",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
