    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "The \"Sunburst\" motif is another of the most iconic elements in YSL jewelry design, inspired by the Moroccan sunshine beloved by founder Yves Saint Laurent. Its radiating sunbeams carry dramatic tension while calling to mind Byzantine art. The collection spans earrings, brooches, rings, and more, rendered in antiqued palladium-tone metal that traces the sun's rays, set with cabochon resin stones in burgundy, olive green, and black. The bold, oversized proportions project a rebellious, unapologetic attitude.",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
